      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11901246::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12497879::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cu addition will form a nano- or microscale Cu-rich phase dispersed throughout the HEA matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cu-rich phase will act as thermal bridges while the HEA matrix maintains mechanical stability.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper has high intrinsic thermal conductivity.",
